  <Document>
    <name>Northeast Philadelphia Eruv- New Boundries as of 5786 -2026</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Rhawnhurst is included in the Northeast Philadelphia Eruv.<br>Eruv status updates are sent weekly via the JCOR community email group. <br>https://groups.io/g/JCOR-NE-Philadelphia<br><br>There are many costs involved in maintaining the eruv. These include the hiring of a bucket truck when needed, insurance, the telephone hotline, materials, and other costs. To help defray these costs, those using the eruv are asked to send $100 annual dues to:<br><br>Northeast Eruv Corporation<br>8201 Castor Avenue<br>Philadelphia, PA 19152<br><br>Also, volunteers are needed to help check and maintain the eruv. If you would like to volunteer, please call Jay Press at 215-722-3766]]></description>
